---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';

const title = 'Crowd: built to forget';
const description =
  'Crowd is anonymous, ephemeral, location-bounded messaging. Posts reach the people near you, last only as long as you choose, and then they are gone.';
---

<Base title={title} description={description}>
  <section class="hero">
    <h1>Built to forget.</h1>
    <p class="tagline">A place to organize, where nothing lingers.</p>
    <p class="lede">
      Crowd is anonymous, ephemeral, location-bounded messaging. Posts reach the
      people near you, last only as long as you choose, and then they are gone.
      No feed history, no profiles, no permanent record.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="block">
    <h2>How posts work</h2>
    <p>
      Every post has a place and a clock. You set how far it reaches and how long
      it lives, anywhere from a few minutes to several hours. When the time runs
      out, the post disappears for everyone. People nearby can <strong>relay</strong> a
      post to carry it a little further than its origin.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="block">
    <h2>How crowds work</h2>
    <p>
      A <strong>crowd</strong> is a trusted, invite-only group. Share a code in
      person or send a link to bring someone in. A crowd, and everything posted
      inside it, lasts up to 24 hours, then disappears completely.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="block">
    <h2>How identity works</h2>
    <p>
      There are no accounts. Your identity is generated on your device and
      rotates as your posts expire, so nothing you do is tied to a lasting
      profile. Nothing to sign up for, nothing to log in to.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="block values">
    <h2>What we don't do</h2>
    <p>
      Privacy by design. No engagement metrics, no algorithm deciding what you
      see, no surveillance. Crowd doesn't measure you, and it isn't built to keep
      you scrolling.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="cta">
    <p class="cta-note">TestFlight beta coming soon.</p>
    <p class="cta-sub">
      Questions in the meantime? Email{' '}
      <a href="mailto:hello@joincrowd.app">hello@joincrowd.app</a>.
    </p>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .hero {
    margin-bottom: 3.5rem;
  }

  .hero h1 {
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
    font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 6vw, 3rem);
  }

  .tagline {
    margin: 0 0 2rem;
    font-family: 'Libre Baskerville', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 1.1875rem;
    color: var(--ember);
  }

  .lede {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    color: var(--ink-2);
    max-width: 34rem;
  }

  .block {
    padding-block: 1.75rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }

  .block h2 {
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
    font-size: 1.25rem;
  }

  .block p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--ink-2);
    max-width: 34rem;
  }

  strong {
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .cta {
    margin-top: 2.75rem;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--rule);
    border-radius: 0.625rem;
  }

  .cta-note {
    margin: 0 0 0.375rem;
    font-family: 'Libre Baskerville', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .cta-sub {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: var(--dust);
  }
</style>
